## Page & Tab Flow

We will structure the main navigation into five primary pages/tabs:
1. **Home**: High-torque welcome hub presenting the features, quick-start shortcuts, and current status.
2. **Calculators**: Grid of the 6 core calculators (EMI, SIP, Compound, Simple, Amortization, Goal Planner).
3. **Tracker**: Personal transaction log. Allows adding/editing/deleting transactions, custom sorting/filtering, and exporting to CSV.
4. **Dashboard**: Financial analytics center. Visual metrics showing balance, monthly income vs expense, category breakdown (Donut chart), and income vs expense trends (Bar chart).
5. **History**: Persistent log of all calculations saved by the user (if logged in). Allows viewing details and reloading them into calculators.

